OL,3,GNEWSAMP urges NHS trust to expand
OL,4,Abullying probe
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn investigation into claims of
OL,7,Fbullying, harassment and discrimination
OL,8,Fat the general surgery department at a
OL,9,FSussex hospital trust should be
OL,10,Fexpanded trust-wide, the local MP says.
OL,12,FEast Sussex Healthcare NHS Trust (ESHT)
OL,13,Fruns Eastbourne District General
OL,14,FHospital and Conquest Hospital in St
OL,15,FLeonards.
OL,17,FAs reported last month by the BBC, this
OL,18,Finvestigation found that a "significant
OL,19,Fproportion" of staff had reported
OL,20,Fexperiencing bullying, harassment or
OL,21,Fdiscrimination within the previous
OL,22,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
